Third-party material
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT license above covers this project's own work. The third-party
material below keeps its own license, as listed.

Letter meshes (Assets/Content/Minigames/NamePop/Letters.fbx)
  "Simple alphabet" by Naira, licensed under CC BY 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
  https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/simple-alphabet-86bc96d947054d9398402069c02f96fc
  Changed: centred, scaled, made thinner.

Fabric, wall and floor textures (Assets/Art/Textures), processed with
tools/blender/textures/adapt.py:
  Poly Haven, CC0 1.0 (https://polyhaven.com/license):
    "Caban" (T_Fleece), "Ribbed Corduroy" (T_Corduroy),
    "Plastered Wall" (T_Plaster), "Wood Floor" (T_WoodFloor).
  ambientCG, CC0 1.0 (https://docs.ambientcg.com/license/):
    "Fabric016" (T_Knit).
  The wicker and strand textures are made procedurally in this project.

Sound sources processed into the parents' voices
(Assets/Content/Audio/Voices/Bups) and the intro audio:
  "Cat Purr 301 M" by BadIdeaProductions, CC0 1.0.
  https://freesound.org/s/856508/
  Sonniss GDC Game Audio Bundle, Sonniss royalty-free license
  (https://sonniss.com/gameaudiogdc). Used only processed and mixed into
  the game's own sounds, not redistributed as standalone sound effects.

TextMesh Pro resources (Assets/TextMesh Pro)
  Unity Companion License (https://unity.com/legal/licenses/unity-companion-license).
  LiberationSans font: SIL Open Font License 1.1.
